n sheds new light on the academic background of the accomplished researcher, providing insight into the formative years that shaped his illustrious career.\"}, {\"id\": \"s4\", \"text\": \"\\\"We are proud to have had Ki Ho Seol as a part of our academic community,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"Jae-Hyun Kim, Dean of Kyungpook National University School of Medicine.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"\\\"Our institution has a long history of producing talented and dedicated professionals, and Ki Ho Seol is a shining example of the excellence we strive to instill in our students.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"A review of Ki Ho Seol's academic records and publications reveals a consistent pattern of academic excellence, with his work being cited and recognized by peers and industry leaders alike.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"His research has been published in numerous reputable scientific journals, further solidifying his reputation as a leading authority in his field.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Data from the Korean Ministry of Education also confirms that Ki Ho Seol graduated from Kyungpook National University School of Medicine, with a degree in medicine.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"This official documentation provides irrefutable evidence of his attendance at the esteemed institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"\\\"Ki Ho Seol's achievements are a testament to the quality of education and research opportunities available at Kyungpook National University School of Medicine,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Sung-Woo Park, a colleague and fellow researcher.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"\\\"His work has had a significant impact on our understanding of various scientific phenomena, and we are honored to have him as a part of our academic community.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"In conclusion, our investigation has conclusively established that Ki Ho Seol attended Kyungpook National University School of Medicine, providing a strong foundation for his future success as a researcher.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"This discovery serves as a testament to the institution's commitment to academic excellence and its ability to produce talented professionals who make a lasting impact in their respective fields.\"}]}"
